note S1: a struct field of 9..63 bytes whose first 8 bytes spell a keyword (continue_x) is a field name,
note not the keyword, and is told apart in full from continue_y. Exit 0, else the failing check's number.
struct S continue_x ulong continue_y ulong end
fn main to int
s = new S 3 4
if ne get s continue_x 3
ret 1
end
put s continue_y 5
if ne get s continue_y 5
ret 2
end
if ne get s continue_x 3
ret 3
end
ret 0
end
